{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f125d0cc7d71e220f86a4ac2f2083123bfc362cd9624e4ab85c49c45d4af3fef", "ja": "上は苺のムース、下はレアチーズケーキだったっけ。\nふたつの味が一緒に楽しめるんだよね……♪", "zh": "上面是草莓慕斯，下面是半熟芝士蛋糕来着。\n能同时享受到两种口味呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "4fc69875f27b560209253f75023e7dac27238f244aca1e7990bd38ab27979fce", "ja": "う～考えれば考えるほど食べたくなってきちゃった！\n今度のお休みの日に買いに行ってみようかな？", "zh": "呜～越想越想吃了！\n下次休息日要不要去买来尝尝呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea0b2fc8f8ef87c88780f0d86e2b827fe29cc0d8acc7bdee4b8564e58b57bbf5", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\n何か買い出しに行くんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。你要去买什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "64d280abade7fe15fd0add54e2d78a181718936ae766ae0d0b3db9abe2272abd", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です！\nちょっと、ケーキを買いに行こうかなって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我想去买个蛋糕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "301be467f58d528c4e3388eefff12e322961b13cb8b2bd4eb789ae648cf2f2ea", "ja": "テレビで見たケーキがすごく美味しそうで。\n甘いと甘酸っぱいのスペシャルハーモニー……♪", "zh": "电视上看到的蛋糕看起来特别好吃。\n甜味与酸甜味的特别和声……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "60d9dfe8426161e8484134d5ad459fc3899f24dcd3c7494a751bdc521accf5a1", "ja": "へぇ、それはちょっと気になるな。\nよかったらお店、教えてくれませんか？", "zh": "哦，听起来还真让人在意。\n方便的话，可以告诉我店在哪儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "130ae240e6b94a7772ceeac825c1259a78ec90bcc4c14e54acaf168f3c045a78", "ja": "もちろんです！\nえっと確かどこかにメモを……。", "zh": "当然可以！\n我记得笔记放在哪里的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c502230bfd9389bb51a9a2763fd6589101d45e6e2290c7740adc63e21575b89", "ja": "あ、スペシャルハーモニーといえば！　社長さんが\n{$P$}さんをお呼びでしたよ。", "zh": "啊，说到特别和声！社长刚才叫您去{$P$}先生那边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "7f83b5c7c87bb4a4111cf621e2a5243d0e7f851e8f5bb419edd26979ec2d3869", "ja": "なんでも、デュオにピッタリの曲が\n届いたんだとか！", "zh": "听说有一首非常适合二重唱的歌曲送到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "468518eb79e6dec04dfac00e7b740dd6889da9bef0cf1787b5e6af55288e2a49", "ja": "おお、デュオ曲ですか。いいですね。\n早速行ってみます！", "zh": "哦，是双人曲啊。不错呢。\n我们马上去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "6f080a441a7966f78856c7bab04b5fd12a9eb7a43a21bf0137dd62cb2f9478a2", "ja": "はーい！　ケーキのお店は、\nあとでメッセージ入れておきますね～♪", "zh": "好——！蛋糕店的消息，我之后发给您哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "e76a393d85ce20a4a3c806fb2d9a4aff4ca2fe47d95490a135ec2d5f6fcf9fde", "ja": "しゃ、社長！\nまさか食べたんですか……アレを……！？", "zh": "社、社长！\n难道您吃掉了吗……那个……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "7d84aa50bec056642addd381f300a57eae4420e50e56e32994ada86f3c086b46", "ja": "うむ。思わぬルートから手に入ってね。\n音無君にも食べさせてやりたかったんだが……！", "zh": "嗯。是从意想不到的途径弄到手的。\n本想也分给音无你尝尝的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cfd74853d6fc088d7802be373796456b2d3a507a04520d9187c0c115c08db29b", "ja": "……お疲れ様です。社長、音無さん。\nなんだか妙な空気ですね？", "zh": "……辛苦了。社长、音无小姐。\n总觉得气氛有点奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "b971445ea49892a2f02d8c1f28e3bea1009a2b061d0a09de1f0eb2d3515bf242", "ja": "あ、聞いてくださいよ、{$P$}さん！\n社長があの幻のケーキを食べたって言うんです！", "zh": "啊，请您听我说，{$P$}先生！\n社长说他吃到了那个传说中的蛋糕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "9e0fb1a868651595651385c1b7821f16948c6f7a9cdacee4288d7195742f1b84", "ja": "甘いと甘酸っぱいのスペシャルハーモニー……♪\nううっ、私も食べてみたい……！", "zh": "甜味与酸甜的特别和谐……♪\n呜呜，我也好想尝尝……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "913602ada169bcb6442c655dfd6329eb7ed1932342728409962b80fa1b11f377", "ja": "ああ、その話さっき青羽さんからも聞きましたよ。\nすごく流行ってるんですね、そのケーキ。", "zh": "啊，这件事我刚才也听青羽小姐说过了。\n那种蛋糕非常流行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "e846c1586a5bb0e3db55a7537b6098549aeb37bec66b93a1604f750ad982be7b", "ja": "いやぁ、あれはなかなかの代物だった。\n二層の重なりが味に深みを出していてね……。", "zh": "哎呀，那可真是个好东西。\n双层的重叠赋予了味道深邃的层次感呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "9bfc37771c97566d9490376b5a75b81c2c155de7cf70e4836bea82ef971c313d", "ja": "そこでピンと来たのだよ！\nあの曲はデュオでこそ映えるんじゃないかとね！", "zh": "我就是在那时突然想到的！\n那首歌不正是双人组合才更出彩吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "22d41ea563ec5d1f6f10bf6c08941a598960b958240c346b2d3e5fe7989a10b4", "ja": "あの曲……というのが、今回のお話ですね？", "zh": "那首曲子……就是这次要谈的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "5f9d82673fa2145982ed0122b69c6bba618454e116492ade8a2c3518e6a7745a", "ja": "その通り。先日、いいのができたからと持ち込まれた\n曲があってね。これだ！と思ったわけだ。", "zh": "没错。前几天有人拿来一首说是创作得很不错的曲子，我一听就觉得，就是它了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "619ecc05ab2e6fcd986aa5869948d547345daeabb8ee9a42145c8e93aa076a41", "ja": "君には、この曲を歌うにふさわしい\nベストな二人を決めてもらいたい。", "zh": "我希望你能选出最适合\n演唱这首歌的最佳两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "81d5e427cc760c187aa79bfeb592508d01d5264b051292c6fb6e9af775513365", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことでしたか。\nもちろん任せてください！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n当然，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "c1a25e3046b5699c5d37556f981e32554ba58f0907f226098977ca6779e905ba", "ja": "うむ！　幻のケーキなど目じゃない\nスペシャルなハーモニーを聞かせてくれたまえよ！", "zh": "嗯！那传说中的蛋糕根本不值一提\n让我听听你们特别的和声吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "5369a1949755bfe9f939a60ecc24809a8aebab2124098861ba1b7be83a04e9b4", "ja": "うふふ、それぐらい{$P$}さんなら\n朝飯前ですよね？　ケーキだけに！　なんちゃって♪", "zh": "呵呵，这种程度对{$P$}先生来说\n肯定是小菜一碟吧？既然都说到蛋糕了！开个玩笑啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "bd94a19b2240d5a4d62a875f6b433d6fb7edfab5be350294218624799ee94403", "ja": "はい！　期待に応えられるように頑張ります！", "zh": "好的！我会努力不辜负您的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "47cc1810f8c429a61cd947983d6896c524408b869b897b9696b1fb206cb8cd02", "ja": "（デュオの新曲か。組み合わせで可能性は無限大……。\nさて、今回は誰に頼もうかな？）", "zh": "（二人组合的新歌吗？通过不同的组合，可能性是无限的……那么，这次要找谁来唱呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
